          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. In the figure below, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "AB = AD, CB = CD."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.113,
            0.847,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you identify any pair of congruent triangles? If yes, explain why they are congruent."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.157,
            0.838,
            0.178
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Does AC divide "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle  BAD"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle  BCD"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " into two equal parts? Give reasons."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
