            0.848,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. In the figure below, are ΔDFE and ΔGED congruent to each other? It is given that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { D F } = \\mathrm { D G }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{FE} \\equiv \\mathrm{GE}."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
