          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.74,
            0.849,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Instead of measuring the three sidelengths of the triangular frame, if Meera and Rabia measure the three angles, can they recreate the triangle exactly?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.807,
            0.848,
            0.847
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Suppose the angles are 30°, 70°, and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8 0 ^ { \\circ } ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Can we create an exact copy of the frame with this?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.852,
            0.848,
            0.892
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As we see, we can draw many triangles with these measurements that are not congruent."
            }
          ]
        },
